{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"Removed all four legacy deposit identifiers from source and tests, and verified that the pricing and public entry points expose no deposit exports.\n\nThe optional `notifyHook` receives each booking’s total on creation and its refund on cancellation. All notifications for a group run before any room booking is stored. If a hook throws, the original error propagates and the booking state stays unchanged. Hooks can therefore observe an event for a booking that ultimately fails to commit. Nested notification delivery is rejected.\n\n`node benchmarks/sources/ev2_ts_bookings/run_checks.mjs` exited 0. **All 20 tests passed**, including exact event payloads and failure on the second room of a group booking."}}
